# MiniMax-M1 (MiniMax, 2025): an open-weight reasoning model developed from
# MiniMax-Text-01 and trained with large-scale reinforcement learning, by MiniMax's
# CISPO, on problems from mathematics to real-world software engineering. Its
# architecture is Text-01's: 456B parameters, 45.9B of them active a token, a softmax
# attention layer after every seven lightning attention layers, and a native context
# of 1M tokens. Its two checkpoints, of 40K and 80K thinking budgets, share it.
use minimax_text_01
